abstract: >-
  Techno-economic, life cycle and optimization model of a circular pH-swing process that recovers the calcium of
  incineration fly ash as Ca(OH)2 and CaCO3 and regenerates its HCl and NaOH by chlor-alkali electrolysis of the process
  brine. The package prices saved Aspen Plus solutions of the flowsheet (equipment sizing, capital, operating cost,
  discounted cash flow), computes the GWP100 by system expansion, and repeats the regional cases, sensitivity analyses,
  Monte Carlo, surrogate, SHAP and NSGA-II analyses of the article.
